Hey,

I was looking at the BPFK pages today and I noticed that it was treating
things in braces as plugins, then throwing errors when it couldn't find
those plugins.

Example http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-index.php?page=BPFK+Community+Work
{broda} => Internal Error: Plugin *broda* does not exist.

I bring it up because the Community Work page advises people to "Please put
{...} around any cross-references to other Lojban words .... This will not
get marked up, but it will save us a lot of trouble later."

What should we be doing?

mi'e ros.

